#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libadwaita.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>libadwaita</application> package provides additional GTK4 "
"UI widgets for use in developing user interfaces. It is used primarily for "
"GNOME applications."
msgstr ""
"O pacote &quot;<application>libadwaita</application>&quot; fornece pequenas "
"engenhocas adicionais de IU do &quot;GTK4&quot; para uso no desenvolvimento "
"de interfaces de usuário(a). Elas são usadas principalmente para aplicativos"
" &quot;GNOME&quot;."

